    "durationMs": 305445,
    "finalText": "Implementation complete. The URL Shortener API is built and fully verified in /workspace.\n\n**What I built** (Laravel 11.57 on PHP 8.3, MySQL via `DB_*` env vars):\n\n- **Migration** — `links` table: unique `code` (varchar 20), `text url`, `clicks` counter, timestamps\n- **Routes** (`routes/api.php` with `apiPrefix: ''` in `bootstrap/app.php`, so paths are `/links` and `/r/{code}`) → `LinkController`\n- **`POST /links`** — validates url is an absolute http/https URL with a host (filter_var + parse_url checks), optional custom code (`^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{4,20}$`), generates a unique 8-char code when omitted; 201 with `{code, url, clicks: 0}`; duplicate custom code → 409 (both pre-check and unique-index race guard); URL returned byte-identical (`JSON_UNESCAPED_SLASHES`)\n- **`GET /links/{code}`** — 200 / 404 (`error` field); **`GET /r/{code}`** — atomic `increment('clicks')` then 302 to stored URL; **`GET /links`** — `{items, total}` in ascending creation order\n- **422s** — global exception renderers return `{\"error\": ...}` for validation failures and malformed JSON bodies; invalid code format in any path/body → 422, well-formed but unknown code → 404\n- **`start.sh`** — runs `migrate --force`, then `php artisan serve --host=0.0.0.0 --port=8000 --no-reload` in the foreground; `.env` contains no `DB_*` lines so environment variables always win; README documents startup\n\n**Verification**: a 49-check curl suite passed clean (all endpoints, edge cases, error codes), and I confirmed a full server restart preserves links and click counts (migrate → \"Nothing to migrate\", data intact, redirect incremented exactly once). Test data was cleared afterward and the server stopped, so port 8000 is free and the table starts empty."
